    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/4260abbabb8e504786da43e73da1ac13.poster.avif?t=1749541532\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/4260abbabb8e504786da43e73da1ac13.webm?t=1749541532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/4260abbabb8e504786da43e73da1ac13.mp4?t=1749541532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/15a8a61c288b648ceb431975bfa20418.poster.avif?t=1749541532\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/15a8a61c288b648ceb431975bfa20418.webm?t=1749541532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/15a8a61c288b648ceb431975bfa20418.mp4?t=1749541532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A MUCH-ANTICIPATED SEAQUEL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>sea</strong>quel to Pirates Outlaws, a new era begins at New Elysia. Enter your mansion, pick a character, class ability and starting-deck, and embark on a daring expedition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/f866e36e57edfe7bc08d506f2f036233.poster.avif?t=1749541532\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/f866e36e57edfe7bc08d506f2f036233.webm?t=1749541532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/f866e36e57edfe7bc08d506f2f036233.mp4?t=1749541532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALL HANDS ON DECK - CHARACTERS &amp; COMPANIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character has several classes, and each one comes with a pre-made starter deck and one unique ability card. At the Alchemy shop, drinking elixirs alters each hero's abilities, pre-made deck, and appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a companion and add their unique cards to your starter deck. It's your job to discover the many possible strategies created by this combination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinforce your crew throughout your journey by encountering new characters and companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/4c11d0de583475c136a57533cc8df58d.poster.avif?t=1749541532\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/4c11d0de583475c136a57533cc8df58d.webm?t=1749541532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/4c11d0de583475c136a57533cc8df58d.mp4?t=1749541532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTRODUCING NEW FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero has multiple unique cards &amp; abilities that can be combined with companion cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your deck along the way and try to build overpowered strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced turn-based combat: each card played affects a &quot;Countdown&quot; towards the enemy's actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the map, navigate from battle to battle or return to any previously visited island, tavern, market... And thus, giving sailors more freedom of movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New card evolution tree: cards level up when three identical ones are collected. Choose how to evolve them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find relics that provide powerful outfit bonuses. When you complete an outfit, you receive its associated bonus.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/15a8a61c288b648ceb431975bfa20418.poster.avif?t=1749541532\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/15a8a61c288b648ceb431975bfa20418.webm?t=1749541532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/15a8a61c288b648ceb431975bfa20418.mp4?t=1749541532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A MUCH-ANTICIPATED SEAQUEL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>sea</strong>quel to Pirates Outlaws, a new era begins at New Elysia. Enter your mansion, pick a character, class ability and starting-deck, and embark on a daring expedition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/f866e36e57edfe7bc08d506f2f036233.poster.avif?t=1749541532\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/f866e36e57edfe7bc08d506f2f036233.webm?t=1749541532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/f866e36e57edfe7bc08d506f2f036233.mp4?t=1749541532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALL HANDS ON DECK - CHARACTERS &amp; COMPANIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character has several classes, and each one comes with a pre-made starter deck and one unique ability card. At the Alchemy shop, drinking elixirs alters each hero's abilities, pre-made deck, and appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a companion and add their unique cards to your starter deck. It's your job to discover the many possible strategies created by this combination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinforce your crew throughout your journey by encountering new characters and companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/4c11d0de583475c136a57533cc8df58d.poster.avif?t=1749541532\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/4c11d0de583475c136a57533cc8df58d.webm?t=1749541532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/4c11d0de583475c136a57533cc8df58d.mp4?t=1749541532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTRODUCING NEW FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero has multiple unique cards &amp; abilities that can be combined with companion cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your deck along the way and try to build overpowered strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced turn-based combat: each card played affects a &quot;Countdown&quot; towards the enemy's actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the map, navigate from battle to battle or return to any previously visited island, tavern, market... And thus, giving sailors more freedom of movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New card evolution tree: cards level up when three identical ones are collected. Choose how to evolve them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find relics that provide powerful outfit bonuses. When you complete an outfit, you receive its associated bonus.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Pirates Outlaws 2 is a swashbuckling roguelike deckbuilder. Collect &amp; fuse cards, gather powerful relics and adapt your strategy during each run. Become a reputed pirate, loot the Sea Masters, challenge giant creatures and triumph in the great Arena!",
